2118
00:03:30,187 --> 00:03:31,607
Welcome...

2119
00:03:32,197 --> 00:03:34,197
to City Lights Bookstore...

2120
00:03:35,197 --> 00:03:36,737
traveler.

2121
00:03:36,737 --> 00:03:37,867
Why don't you...

2122
00:03:38,827 --> 00:03:40,077
come this way?

2123
00:03:44,377 --> 00:03:48,337
meditation    in the white darkness

2124
00:03:44,377 --> 00:03:44,917
meditation    in the white darkness

2125
00:03:44,377 --> 00:03:48,337
meditation    in the white darkness

2126
00:03:44,377 --> 00:03:44,917
meditation    in the white darkness

2127
00:03:44,377 --> 00:03:44,917
meditation    in the white darkness

2128
00:04:01,307 --> 00:04:03,347
Let's wait a bit...

2129
00:04:03,897 --> 00:04:08,067
for the tea leaves to open up nicely.

2130
00:04:08,397 --> 00:04:09,477
Now...

2131
00:04:09,977 --> 00:04:11,397
traveler...

2132
00:04:12,237 --> 00:04:14,567
I'm lost.

2133
00:04:15,277 --> 00:04:18,277
Everyone who comes here says that.

2134
00:04:18,277 --> 00:04:19,907
The mist was so thick...

2135
00:04:20,657 --> 00:04:22,657
That you couldn't see one step ahead of you?

2136
00:04:23,117 --> 00:04:25,537
People used to say that a lot.

2137
00:04:25,997 --> 00:04:28,917
They also used to say that anything that happens in the darkness

2138
00:04:28,917 --> 00:04:31,667
stays in the darkness.

2139
00:04:31,667 --> 00:04:34,547
My ship should be around here somewhere.

2140
00:04:34,837 --> 00:04:36,927
Whatever you've been searching for

2141
00:04:36,927 --> 00:04:39,757
has always been right there inside your heart.

2142
00:04:40,597 --> 00:04:42,267
That's how things work.

2143
00:04:42,847 --> 00:04:45,897
Have you seen a girl-type autoreiv?

2144
00:04:47,057 --> 00:04:49,857
Her name is Pino, and she's about this tall-

2145
00:04:49,267 --> 00:04:51,067
Don't be impatient.

2146
00:04:51,527 --> 00:04:53,187
It's just like that tea over there.

2147
00:04:53,647 --> 00:04:56,107
A good steep deepens its flavor.

2148
00:04:56,657 --> 00:04:59,987
You can't seek everything at once.

2149
00:05:00,697 --> 00:05:03,447
Besides, this is a bookstore.

2150
00:05:04,787 --> 00:05:06,617
I'm really sorry,

2151
00:05:07,037 --> 00:05:09,417
but I just wanted to ask for directions.

2152
00:05:12,207 --> 00:05:15,587
Well, since there are so many books, I guess there must be one...

2153
00:05:16,467 --> 00:05:20,427
that I'd want to read at least... maybe.

2154
00:05:20,427 --> 00:05:21,597
Come now.

2155
00:05:21,597 --> 00:05:24,637
Try holding one in your hands first.

2156
00:05:45,037 --> 00:05:49,037
It seems he has not yet realized

2157
00:05:50,167 --> 00:05:52,997
that we are on a special stage.

2158
00:05:53,747 --> 00:05:57,467
In other words, we're inside his mind.

2159
00:06:01,927 --> 00:06:05,427
In order for so many books to exist like this,

2160
00:06:05,427 --> 00:06:11,107
readers must first create something that can be called a society.

2161
00:06:12,107 --> 00:06:15,737
However, in order for people to create a society,

2162
00:06:16,237 --> 00:06:19,067
there must be communication with words.

2163
00:06:20,357 --> 00:06:21,567
Indeed...

2164
00:06:22,027 --> 00:06:24,697
the chicken-or-egg dilemma.

2165
00:06:25,237 --> 00:06:29,537
Since you can't have one without the other...

2166
00:06:30,747 --> 00:06:37,507
it is impossible to determine that books
 are a result of a strictly <i>human</i> endeavor.

2167
00:06:39,337 --> 00:06:44,507
One is tempted to believe a divine
 entity bestowed books upon mankind...

2168
00:06:45,637 --> 00:06:47,517
though that is impossible as well.

2169
00:06:48,347 --> 00:06:51,097
Rousseau's <i>On the Origin of Language</i>?

2170
00:06:53,107 --> 00:06:56,397
Well then, shall we set aside the esoteric for now

2171
00:06:56,397 --> 00:07:00,397
and continue with a look at the past and future of this fellow

2172
00:07:00,397 --> 00:07:04,827
who has been controlled by a strange fate?

2173
00:07:08,697 --> 00:07:10,747
Why is my name on this book?

2174
00:07:13,917 --> 00:07:15,247
Where did he go?

2175
00:07:25,257 --> 00:07:26,757
How is this...

2176
00:07:30,227 --> 00:07:31,557
Impossible!

2177
00:07:44,197 --> 00:07:45,237
This is a dream?

2178
00:07:45,237 --> 00:07:46,947
Of course not,

2179
00:07:46,947 --> 00:07:48,407
Vincent Law.

2180
00:07:51,037 --> 00:07:52,707
This way, over here.

2181
00:07:52,707 --> 00:07:53,457
Who is it?

2182
00:07:56,127 --> 00:07:57,497
Dorothy...

2183
00:07:58,297 --> 00:08:00,047
I am no one.

2184
00:08:00,047 --> 00:08:04,217
Even if I were someone, no one could comprehend that.

2185
00:08:04,927 --> 00:08:06,717
Even if they could,

2186
00:08:07,007 --> 00:08:09,347
I couldn't communicate that to those around me.

2187
00:08:09,347 --> 00:08:10,597
Chief...

2188
00:08:10,597 --> 00:08:12,227
That's how it is...

2189
00:08:12,517 --> 00:08:14,347
You know that, don't you?

2190
00:08:21,397 --> 00:08:22,737
This is a dream.

2191
00:08:22,737 --> 00:08:25,987
Of course not, Vincent Law.

2192
00:08:26,367 --> 00:08:30,037
According to the perspective of others, I am a part of the world,

2193
00:08:30,037 --> 00:08:34,367
but from <i>my</i> perspective, as someone who
 contemplates the world, I do not exist within it.

2194
00:08:34,667 --> 00:08:37,207
What I see is the world,

2195
00:08:37,207 --> 00:08:41,007
and I am merely the perspective that gives shape to the world.

2196
00:08:41,007 --> 00:08:43,757
I cannot be part of the world.

2197
00:08:43,757 --> 00:08:46,507
That is true in principle-

2198
00:08:52,177 --> 00:08:53,977
I am no one.

2199
00:08:53,977 --> 00:08:56,147
Even if I were someone,

2200
00:08:56,147 --> 00:08:58,307
no one could comprehend that.

2201
00:08:59,017 --> 00:09:01,067
Even if they could,

2202
00:09:01,067 --> 00:09:03,487
I couldn't communicate that to those around me.

2203
00:09:05,197 --> 00:09:07,697
I am not a part of this world.

2204
00:09:08,317 --> 00:09:11,037
That is the limitation of this world

2205
00:09:11,037 --> 00:09:13,537
and the boundary between my ego and the world.

2206
00:09:13,537 --> 00:09:18,997
I received information that an infected autoreiv had been spotted.

2207
00:09:19,287 --> 00:09:20,997
That's not true.

2208
00:09:20,997 --> 00:09:24,507
It is not "I think, therefore I am".

2209
00:09:25,087 --> 00:09:26,877
But... it's true.

2210
00:09:26,877 --> 00:09:29,257
If you would search the facility's data records...

2211
00:09:29,927 --> 00:09:31,347
Yes,

2212
00:09:31,347 --> 00:09:34,057
it is "I think, therefore <i>you</i> are",

2213
00:09:34,517 --> 00:09:36,767
though I doubt you remember.

2214
00:09:37,057 --> 00:09:38,227
Wait...

2215
00:09:38,227 --> 00:09:39,857
Then tell me!

2216
00:09:40,307 --> 00:09:42,067
What is that monster?

2217
00:09:42,687 --> 00:09:44,567
What in the world is PROXY?

2218
00:09:45,147 --> 00:09:47,357
The PROXY, a monster?

2219
00:09:48,527 --> 00:09:50,867
You're a naÃ¯ve young lady.

2220
00:09:50,867 --> 00:09:55,077
They're called monsters and
 demons and such, but that's all hogwash.

2221
00:09:53,577 --> 00:09:55,077
Miss Re-l!

2222
00:09:55,367 --> 00:09:56,537
PROXIES are...

2223
00:09:56,537 --> 00:09:57,577
Who <i>you</i> are...

2224
00:09:58,417 --> 00:10:01,787
They can shapeshift into anything.

2225
00:10:02,247 --> 00:10:05,337
They can easily make themselves vanish.

2226
00:10:05,337 --> 00:10:07,087
That is who <i>you</i> are.

2227
00:10:07,417 --> 00:10:11,717
They can sneak into the human mind and manipulate it at will.

2228
00:10:11,717 --> 00:10:13,507
That's <i>you</i>.

2229
00:10:13,507 --> 00:10:17,227
They can produce lightning and incinerate this area in an instant.

2230
00:10:17,227 --> 00:10:18,847
Remember.

2231
00:10:18,227 --> 00:10:21,397
They've called forth planets that spout flames too.

2232
00:10:21,397 --> 00:10:22,647
Ergo PROXY-

2233
00:10:22,647 --> 00:10:23,727
No!

2234
00:10:23,727 --> 00:10:24,477
I am...

2235
00:10:24,477 --> 00:10:26,487
I am Vincent Law!

2236
00:10:41,707 --> 00:10:46,087
Registration number 0724FGARK...

2237
00:10:46,087 --> 00:10:47,717
I am Vincent Law...

2238
00:10:57,057 --> 00:10:58,767
You are a fool.

2239
00:10:59,187 --> 00:11:02,807
Having lost your memories, have
 you also lost the ability to see the truth?

2240
00:11:03,437 --> 00:11:04,567
Memories?

2241
00:11:04,567 --> 00:11:07,147
I <i>have</i> my memories!

2242
00:11:07,147 --> 00:11:09,197
Then who are you?

2243
00:11:09,197 --> 00:11:11,777
Try telling me who you are.

2244
00:11:13,947 --> 00:11:14,907
I...

2245
00:11:21,077 --> 00:11:22,207
I...

2246
00:11:22,207 --> 00:11:24,537
was working in Romdeau's Control Division

2247
00:11:24,537 --> 00:11:27,337
after immigrating to Romdeau Dome.

2248
00:11:27,877 --> 00:11:29,377
And before that?

2249
00:11:31,007 --> 00:11:34,637
I was looking for a job in interim immigrant sectors F and G.

2250
00:11:34,637 --> 00:11:36,387
More importantly,

2251
00:11:37,177 --> 00:11:39,177
I saw Miss Re-l there for the first time.

2252
00:11:40,937 --> 00:11:42,387
And before that?

2253
00:11:43,977 --> 00:11:45,857
Before I immigrated to Romdeau,

2254
00:11:45,857 --> 00:11:47,647
I was in Mosk Dome.

2255
00:11:48,107 --> 00:11:50,647
The city had collapsed from a mysterious accident.

2256
00:11:52,657 --> 00:11:54,657
It was a horrifying sight.

2257
00:11:54,657 --> 00:11:56,157
And before that?

2258
00:11:57,827 --> 00:11:59,367
I was in Mosk.

2259
00:12:01,657 --> 00:12:03,537
And what were you doing there?

2260
00:12:04,667 --> 00:12:06,377
I'm trying to think back right now!

2261
00:12:06,667 --> 00:12:08,167
What were you doing?

2262
00:12:08,917 --> 00:12:10,417
I can't remember...

2263
00:12:13,467 --> 00:12:17,177
That is because you don't want to remember.

2264
00:12:17,507 --> 00:12:18,387
Come,

2265
00:12:18,387 --> 00:12:20,637
try answering my question.

2266
00:12:24,437 --> 00:12:27,817
As long as you cannot find that answer,

2267
00:12:27,817 --> 00:12:31,687
even if I were to give it to you, you
 would not be able to understand it.

2268
00:12:31,687 --> 00:12:32,567
Why?

2269
00:12:32,567 --> 00:12:33,947
I told you, didn't I?

2270
00:12:33,947 --> 00:12:35,947
It's because I am you.

2271
00:12:36,277 --> 00:12:37,197
Look.

2272
00:12:39,077 --> 00:12:40,407
No...

2273
00:12:40,407 --> 00:12:41,577
I...

2274
00:12:44,617 --> 00:12:45,997
It's a dream...

2275
00:12:45,997 --> 00:12:49,667
Of course not, Vincent Law.

2276
00:12:59,097 --> 00:13:02,347
To a bookstore, books are invaluable.

2277
00:13:02,347 --> 00:13:05,477
The magic that words written within books possess...

2278
00:13:06,147 --> 00:13:08,767
What rules this world is <i>logos</i>...

2279
00:13:09,317 --> 00:13:10,477
In other words,

2280
00:13:10,477 --> 00:13:13,937
the mysteries of the world are shown

2281
00:13:13,937 --> 00:13:17,067
by words that oft say the opposite of what they truly mean.

2282
00:13:18,657 --> 00:13:20,447
It is a truth that transcends time.

2283
00:13:22,367 --> 00:13:28,917
The word <i>bios</i> means both "bow" and "life".

2284
00:13:29,537 --> 00:13:34,127
They sound disparate from each other,

2285
00:13:34,127 --> 00:13:36,717
but both lead to death.

2286
00:13:37,507 --> 00:13:41,007
People of ancient times said pretty clever things, didn't they?

2287
00:13:45,727 --> 00:13:47,517
Anamnesis...

2288
00:13:48,187 --> 00:13:53,777
That word means both "memory" and "recollection".

2289
00:13:54,397 --> 00:13:56,817
A memory that is recalled...

2290
00:13:56,817 --> 00:13:59,987
Who Vincent Law is, what he fears,

2291
00:13:59,987 --> 00:14:01,407
and what he resolves to do...

2292
00:14:01,867 --> 00:14:03,197
here, in this place...

2293
00:14:10,247 --> 00:14:12,037
There was destruction.

2294
00:14:12,037 --> 00:14:13,917
Crises befell a planet.

2295
00:14:14,707 --> 00:14:17,927
The sky was lost, and the sea froze.

2296
00:14:18,837 --> 00:14:23,347
All of nature halted the activities that constituted the circle of life,

2297
00:14:23,347 --> 00:14:26,847
which was essential for humans to be acknowledged.

2298
00:14:27,597 --> 00:14:32,187
Those who possessed the words to tell
 of these matters had already left the stage,

2299
00:14:32,187 --> 00:14:35,857
and it appeared that the curtains had fallen on the system.

2300
00:14:36,147 --> 00:14:37,187
However...

2301
00:14:37,187 --> 00:14:41,867
since even this wasteland forms a circle,

2302
00:14:41,867 --> 00:14:44,657
it has not yet been able to end itself.

2303
00:14:46,287 --> 00:14:47,367
For,

2304
00:14:48,247 --> 00:14:51,327
you still live and exist.

2305
00:14:53,087 --> 00:14:55,337
That fact signifies

2306
00:14:55,337 --> 00:14:59,047
that the world also cannot exist
 unless those it has given life to also exist-

2307
00:14:59,047 --> 00:15:05,847
that the world cannot exist as a world
 unless someone acknowledges its existence.

2308
00:15:06,137 --> 00:15:07,347
For example...

2309
00:15:07,977 --> 00:15:13,357
like the stacks of books that rot without anyone to read them.

2310
00:15:13,357 --> 00:15:14,857
No...

2311
00:15:14,857 --> 00:15:15,937
I...

2312
00:15:16,357 --> 00:15:22,067
That world staked its survival on
 plunging into a new phase yet again.

2313
00:15:22,657 --> 00:15:23,567
See?

2314
00:15:24,867 --> 00:15:27,367
You can hear the heartbeat of beginning, no?

2315
00:15:28,867 --> 00:15:31,117
"The heartbeat of beginning"...

2316
00:15:35,497 --> 00:15:37,667
Stop intervening any further.

2317
00:15:38,207 --> 00:15:39,917
His nerves won't last.

2318
00:15:42,507 --> 00:15:45,097
It seems I got to you in time.

2319
00:15:46,217 --> 00:15:47,387
The heartbeat...

2320
00:15:47,927 --> 00:15:50,427
That is the measure of time for life itself.

2321
00:15:50,977 --> 00:15:56,727
The size of each organism's heart is
 commensurate with the size of its body,

2322
00:15:57,357 --> 00:16:03,447
and the corresponding heartbeat
 determines the length of its life - its life expectancy.

2323
00:16:04,157 --> 00:16:06,367
That is the way of things.

2324
00:16:06,827 --> 00:16:10,327
For beings who do not follow the way,

2325
00:16:10,327 --> 00:16:11,827
fighting one another is utterly meaningless.

2326
00:16:12,117 --> 00:16:14,327
Old windbag.

2327
00:16:14,327 --> 00:16:15,497
You bastard...

2328
00:16:15,497 --> 00:16:18,247
Intervening in the core of his ego?

2329
00:16:18,707 --> 00:16:21,337
Is that how to treat the guardian of memories?

2330
00:16:21,797 --> 00:16:25,837
The guardian of memories that have
 rejected everything is meaningless!

2331
00:16:25,837 --> 00:16:27,717
Come, remember.

2332
00:16:27,717 --> 00:16:28,717
Stop!

2333
00:16:29,097 --> 00:16:30,467
Impossible.

2334
00:16:30,467 --> 00:16:34,097
We changed my heartbeat ourselves.

2335
00:16:34,097 --> 00:16:35,347
Remember.

2336
00:16:35,767 --> 00:16:38,857
Keep your hand on your chest and feel it.

2337
00:16:38,857 --> 00:16:40,357
It's no one else's.

2338
00:16:40,647 --> 00:16:43,357
It's our heartbeat, yours and mine.

2339
00:16:43,357 --> 00:16:46,617
<i>This</i> speaks the world's truth.

2340
00:16:46,617 --> 00:16:51,697
It proves that we are the world itself.

2341
00:16:52,787 --> 00:16:54,787
Follow your instincts.

2342
00:16:57,167 --> 00:16:59,877
The answer is already there.

2343
00:17:07,387 --> 00:17:11,517
The white noise that reverberates within the white darkness

2344
00:17:11,517 --> 00:17:14,637
is a rhythm proving that you're alive-

2345
00:17:15,187 --> 00:17:19,187
heartbeats that will never disappear from this stage...

2346
00:17:19,187 --> 00:17:23,567
<i>I've always tried to become a model citizen...</i>

2347
00:17:23,567 --> 00:17:26,857
<i>suppressing who I am, putting up a front...</i>

2348
00:17:26,857 --> 00:17:29,027
<i>I've been trying desperately...</i>

2349
00:17:29,577 --> 00:17:32,407
<i>all the time... no matter where I am.</i>

2350
00:17:33,157 --> 00:17:36,247
Even if we've run out of words that should be spoken,

2351
00:17:36,247 --> 00:17:41,167
they will one day become pieces that will be
 necessary to form connections with someone.

2352
00:17:41,547 --> 00:17:44,127
<i>And the end result of it all... is this?</i>

2353
00:17:44,587 --> 00:17:47,177
<i>I am a failure, that's what.</i>

2354
00:17:47,177 --> 00:17:49,967
To keep the system called life...

2355
00:17:49,967 --> 00:17:53,177
To keep that world together,

2356
00:17:53,637 --> 00:17:57,687
someone else created us.

2357
00:17:58,097 --> 00:18:01,357
<i>To doubt the system is sin.</i>

2358
00:18:01,357 --> 00:18:02,897
<i>Following all the rules...</i>

2359
00:18:02,897 --> 00:18:05,737
<i>That is the prerequisite of a model citizen.</i>

2360
00:18:06,697 --> 00:18:08,277
And as a result,

2361
00:18:08,277 --> 00:18:15,197
within your chest beats the same
 rhythm, the heartbeat of beginning, as mine.

2362
00:18:15,197 --> 00:18:16,407
Listen.

2363
00:18:16,407 --> 00:18:18,117
You hear it, don't you?

2364
00:18:20,167 --> 00:18:21,337
<i>I...</i>

2365
00:18:21,837 --> 00:18:24,587
<i>don't think I can ever become a model citizen.</i>

2366
00:18:25,087 --> 00:18:26,207
<i>Not even at the very end.</i>

2367
00:18:28,717 --> 00:18:30,427
Vincent!

2368
00:18:32,847 --> 00:18:34,007
<i>It's over...</i>

2369
00:18:34,677 --> 00:18:36,477
<i>Everything...</i>

2370
00:18:36,477 --> 00:18:37,597
<i>is over.</i>

2371
00:18:44,317 --> 00:18:46,357
I am you.

2372
00:18:49,527 --> 00:18:51,527
You are me.

2373
00:18:51,527 --> 00:18:52,527
No!

2374
00:18:52,527 --> 00:18:53,657
I am...

2375
00:18:53,987 --> 00:18:56,407
I am Vincent Law!

2376
00:18:56,697 --> 00:18:58,407
Then look!

2377
00:18:58,407 --> 00:19:00,207
I am you!

2378
00:19:02,247 --> 00:19:03,877
I ask you...

2379
00:19:03,877 --> 00:19:04,707
once again...

2380
00:19:04,997 --> 00:19:08,167
what are you the proxy of?

2381
00:19:15,007 --> 00:19:16,217
I...

2382
00:19:31,527 --> 00:19:32,237
I...

2383
00:19:35,367 --> 00:19:36,407
Miss...

2384
00:19:37,077 --> 00:19:38,077
Re-l?

2385
00:19:40,367 --> 00:19:43,827
Even though I don't remember anything...

2386
00:19:46,247 --> 00:19:49,257
I realized just now...

2387
00:19:50,837 --> 00:19:52,177
I...

2388
00:19:52,177 --> 00:19:54,137
am Ergo PROXY.

2389
00:20:01,057 --> 00:20:03,017
Remember well.

2390
00:20:04,017 --> 00:20:11,857
You are merely standing at the entrance to the lost truths that you should know.

2391
00:20:23,287 --> 00:20:26,207
Well, it's been about three minutes now.

2392
00:20:26,667 --> 00:20:29,757
The tea leaves have opened nicely.

2393
00:20:30,507 --> 00:20:32,507
Now then, please have some.

2394
00:20:36,137 --> 00:20:38,047
What's the matter?

2395
00:20:38,967 --> 00:20:39,847
Oh, well,

2396
00:20:39,847 --> 00:20:41,927
I got lost, and...

2397
00:20:43,057 --> 00:20:46,437
Everyone who comes here says that.

2398
00:20:46,727 --> 00:20:48,437
The mist was so thick...

2399
00:20:49,017 --> 00:20:52,357
"That you couldn't see one step ahead of you" is said a lot.

2400
00:20:52,987 --> 00:20:55,697
It's also said that anything that happens in the darkness

2401
00:20:55,697 --> 00:20:57,947
stays in the darkness.

2402
00:20:58,237 --> 00:21:02,447
My ship should be docked around here somewhere.

2403
00:21:02,747 --> 00:21:05,327
Whatever you've been searching for

2404
00:21:05,327 --> 00:21:09,497
has always been right there inside your heart.

2405
00:21:10,337 --> 00:21:13,257
Have you seen a child-type autoreiv?

2406
00:21:13,717 --> 00:21:14,967
Her name is Pino...

2407
00:21:15,337 --> 00:21:18,427
I can't answer every question at once.

2408
00:21:19,757 --> 00:21:20,677
The ship...

2409
00:21:20,677 --> 00:21:22,057
no, Pino.

2410
00:21:22,517 --> 00:21:23,727
Have you seen her?

2411
00:21:23,727 --> 00:21:25,017
No.

2412
00:21:25,517 --> 00:21:28,517
What you need to do is to accept.

2413
00:21:29,107 --> 00:21:32,107
If you do not, you will wander, lost in a world of darkness,

2414
00:21:32,107 --> 00:21:35,487
and lose sight of the most important thing.

2415
00:21:35,777 --> 00:21:37,607
I have accepted it long ago.

2416
00:21:37,607 --> 00:21:39,367
That's impressive.

2417
00:21:39,367 --> 00:21:42,117
Then what have you accepted?

2418
00:21:43,367 --> 00:21:45,037
Now, please answer.

2419
00:21:45,037 --> 00:21:46,957
I'm lost!

2420
00:21:46,957 --> 00:21:48,207
That's all!

2421
00:21:49,707 --> 00:21:51,627
Well done.

2422
00:21:52,587 --> 00:21:55,797
Then I shall show you the path you must take.

2423
00:21:56,257 --> 00:21:58,087
Vincent Law-

2424
00:21:58,087 --> 00:22:01,047
no, Ergo PROXY.

2425
00:22:01,927 --> 00:22:03,137
Wait!

2426
00:22:39,467 --> 00:22:40,927
Vince?

2427
00:22:43,807 --> 00:22:45,387
Vince!

2428
00:23:14,417 --> 00:23:16,377
<i>I finally understand now.</i>

2429
00:23:18,337 --> 00:23:20,927
<i>I am... PROXY!</i>

2430
00:23:33,937 --> 00:23:35,857
I've finally found you.

2431
00:23:39,947 --> 00:23:41,237
This is a dream.

2432
